{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02403","headline":"後渚置酒 · 陈叔达","name":"後渚置酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大渚初惊夜，中流沸鼓鼙。\n寒沙满曲浦，夕雾上邪谿。\n岸广凫飞急，云深鴈度低。\n严关犹未遂，此夕待晨鸡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈叔达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}